3.01 114.25 678.07 116.34 681.79 120.07C681.79 120.07 863.19 301.95 863.19 301.95C866.9 305.66 868.98 310.69 868.98 315.94Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Add images and documents</span>\n        <p>Upload related documents, certificates and photographs</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1080 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M362.92 564.45C362.92 564.45 480.24 668.77 480.24 668.77C480.24 668.77 717.08 411.23 717.08 411.23\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M908.94 540C908.94 743.76 743.76 908.94 540 908.94C336.24 908.94 171.06 743.76 171.06 540C171.06 336.24 336.24 171.06 540 171.06C743.76 171.06 908.94 336.24 908.94 540Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Submit</span>\n        <p>Done — a specialist will be in touch shortly</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Bringing your work to sale -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Bringing your work to sale</h2>\n    <p>Once you confirm that you wish to sell through Hong Kong Auction, a sales representative will guide you through the whole process, including signing the consignment contract and arranging insurance, shipping and photography. Your property is held in our secure, climate-controlled storage until the sale has concluded. For the detailed terms, see Chapter Two of the Business Rules, covering sellers.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Offices worldwide -->\n  <section class=\"closing\">\n    <h2>Offices worldwide</h2>\n    <p>Hong Kong Auction has offices in major cities including Macau, Taipei, Beijing, Shanghai, Tokyo and New York. Our specialists also travel to these cities during open consignment periods to meet collectors.</p>\n  </section>\n\n</main>', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. 設計變數\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* 品牌金 */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* 標題深色 */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* 正文 */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* 次要文字 */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* 分隔線 */\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* 淺米底 */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* 內容最大寬度 */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. 基礎重置\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial,\n    \"PingFang TC\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Noto Sans TC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. 版面骨架\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* 頁首 */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* 標題下的金色短線 */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n  .page-header .lede {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. 章節\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. 估值流程三步（圖示 + 標題 + 說明）\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .steps {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 48px);\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;          /* 窄屏直向堆疊 */\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n  }\n\n  .steps > li { text-align: center; }\n\n  .steps .icon {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 110px;\n    margin: 0 auto 18px;\n  }\n  .steps .icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  /* 線條圖示統一用文字色，改色只需動這裡 */\n  .steps .icon svg [stroke] { stroke: var(--ink); }\n  .steps .icon svg [fill]:not([fill=\"none\"]) { fill: var(--ink); }\n\n  .steps .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: .4em;\n  }\n  .steps p {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: .9375rem;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. 頁尾區塊\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .closing {\n    margin-top: var(--gap);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .closing h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .closing p { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. 響應式\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .steps .icon { width: 92px; height: 92px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header, .closing { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>線上估值服務</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">委託香港拍賣</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    <p>香港專家團隊致力為廣大藏家提供專家的藏品估值與市場諮詢服務。透過線上估值系統簡單步驟，我們的專家團隊將會與您聯繫，並提供免費而專業的初步估值、銷售策略與市場分析。</p>\n    <p>查詢已經提交的委託申請進度</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 估值流程三步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1080 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M633.82 134.77C566.93 134.77 544.38 194.14 544.38 194.14C544.38 194.14 521.85 134.77 454.93 134.77C388.05 134.77 347.77 198.52 347.77 251.07C347.77 339.14 544.38 473.35 544.38 473.35C544.38 473.35 740.98 339.16 740.98 251.09C740.98 198.52 700.72 134.77 633.82 134.77C633.82 134.77 633.82 134.77 633.82 134.77Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M633.82 134.77C566.93 134.77 544.38 194.14 544.38 194.14C544.38 194.14 521.85 134.77 454.93 134.77C388.05 134.77 347.77 198.52 347.77 251.07C347.77 339.14 544.38 473.35 544.38 473.35C544.38 473.35 740.98 339.16 740.98 251.09C740.98 198.52 700.72 134.77 633.82 134.77C633.82 134.77 633.82 134.77 633.82 134.77Z\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M540.96 306.13C540.96 306.13 695.73 246.35 695.73 246.35C695.73 246.35 1005.29 366.33 1005.29 366.33C1005.29 366.33 845.04 432.94 845.04 432.94C845.04 432.94 540.96 306.13 540.96 306.13Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M542.33 563.68C542.33 563.68 380.98 624.02 380.98 624.02C380.98 624.02 71.43 494.92 71.43 494.92C71.43 494.92 237.89 429.52 237.89 429.52C237.89 429.52 542.33 563.68 542.33 563.68Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M540.28 304.14C540.28 304.14 231.37 432.37 231.37 432.37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M540.97 990.74C540.97 990.74 849.88 862.51 849.88 862.51C849.88 862.51 849.88 433.14 849.88 433.14C849.88 433.14 540.97 561.37 540.97 561.37C540.97 561.37 540.97 990.74 540.97 990.74Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M232.06 432.73C232.06 432.73 540.97 560.96 540.97 560.96C540.97 560.96 540.97 990.33 540.97 990.33C540.97 990.33 232.06 862.1 232.06 862.1C232.06 862.1 232.06 561.62 232.06 561.62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">填寫藏品資料</span>\n        <p>提供藏品購入年份、價錢及來源等資料</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1080 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M866.9 307.75C866.9 307.75 736.66 307.75 736.66 307.75C703.14 307.75 675.98 280.58 675.98 247.06C675.98 247.06 675.98 116.83 675.98 116.83\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M570.05 442.39C566.39 442.42 562.87 443.88 560.28 446.47C560.28 446.47 476.26 530.48 476.26 530.48C472.72 534.02 471.34 539.19 472.64 544.03C473.93 548.87 477.71 552.65 482.55 553.95C487.39 555.24 492.56 553.86 496.1 550.32C496.1 550.32 556.19 490.23 556.19 490.23C556.19 490.23 556.19 680.42 556.19 680.42C556.14 684.17 557.59 687.78 560.22 690.45C562.85 693.12 566.45 694.62 570.2 694.62C573.94 694.62 577.54 693.12 580.17 690.45C582.8 687.78 584.25 684.17 584.2 680.42C584.2 680.42 584.2 490.23 584.2 490.23C584.2 490.23 644.29 550.32 644.29 550.32C647.83 553.86 653 555.24 657.84 553.95C662.68 552.65 666.46 548.87 667.76 544.03C669.06 539.19 667.67 534.02 664.13 530.48C664.13 530.48 580.11 446.47 580.11 446.47C577.45 443.81 573.82 442.34 570.05 442.39C570.05 442.39 570.05 442.39 570.05 442.39Z\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n          <path d=\"M803.63 923.78C794.11 954.03 765.84 975.97 732.45 975.97C732.45 975.97 288.11 975.97 288.11 975.97C246.91 975.97 213.5 942.56 213.5 901.36C213.5 901.36 213.5 240.46 213.5 240.46C213.5 204.58 238.82 174.62 272.57 167.47\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M868.98 315.94C868.98 315.94 868.98 849.76 868.98 849.76C868.98 890.96 835.57 924.37 794.37 924.37C794.37 924.37 350.03 924.37 350.03 924.37C308.83 924.37 275.43 890.96 275.43 849.76C275.43 849.76 275.43 188.86 275.43 188.86C275.43 147.65 308.83 114.25 350.03 114.25C350.03 114.25 667.75 114.25 667.75 114.25C673.01 114.25 678.07 116.34 681.79 120.07C681.79 120.07 863.19 301.95 863.19 301.95C866.9 305.66 868.98 310.69 868.98 315.94Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">提供圖片及資料</span>\n        <p>上載藏品相關文件、證書及圖片</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1080 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M362.92 564.45C362.92 564.45 480.24 668.77 480.24 668.77C480.24 668.77 717.08 411.23 717.08 411.23\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M908.94 540C908.94 743.76 743.76 908.94 540 908.94C336.24 908.94 171.06 743.76 171.06 540C171.06 336.24 336.24 171.06 540 171.06C743.76 171.06 908.94 336.24 908.94 540Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">提交</span>\n        <p>完成！專家團隊即將與您聯繫</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 登上我們的拍賣專場 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>登上我們的拍賣專場</h2>\n    <p>若您確認將藏品透過香港拍賣上拍，銷售代表將引領您完成整個拍賣程序，包括簽訂《委託拍賣合同》、完成保險、運送與拍攝等安排。閣下藏品亦將保存在我們安全而恆溫的指定倉儲空間直至拍賣結束。你亦可參閱《業務規則》第二章：關於賣家，瞭解具體的條款及細則。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 全球辦事處 -->\n  <section class=\"closing\">\n    <h2>全球辦事處</h2>\n    <p>香港拍賣於各大城市設有辦事處，包括澳門、台北、北京、上海、東京及紐約等。專家團隊亦會於公開徵集期間到訪各大城市，與海內外藏家接洽。</p>\n  </section>\n\n</main>', 1, 1787043366, 1787475021);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (2, '委托拍卖', '委託拍賣', 'Consign to Auction', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. 设计变量\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* 品牌金 */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* 标题深色 */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* 正文 */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* 次要文字 */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* 分隔线 */\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* 浅米底 */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* 内容最大宽度 */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. 基础重置\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial,\n    \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. 版面骨架\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* 页首 */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* 标题下的金色短线 */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. 章节\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  /* 附注／免责说明 */\n  .note {\n    margin-top: 1.5em;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: .9375rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. 清单\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .list, .steps { margin: 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .list:last-child, .steps:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* 项目符号清单 */\n  .list { list-style: none; }\n  .list > li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: .6em; }\n  .list > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .list > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: .82em;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  /* 编号步骤清单 */\n  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }\n  .steps > li {\n    counter-increment: step;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .steps > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .steps > li::before {\n    content: counter(step);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: .25em;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--brand);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--brand);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .steps > li > .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    margin-bottom: .35em;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. 页尾区块\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .closing {\n    margin-top: var(--gap);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .closing h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .closing p { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. 响应式\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .steps > li { padding-left: 36px; }\n    .steps > li::before { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header, .closing, .note { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>委托拍卖</h1>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">通过简单步骤将藏品委托香港拍卖，开启您的卖家体验。我们的专家团队乐意为您提供专业的艺术品估值与市场咨询服务，并协助您完成上拍手续。</p>\n\n  <!-- 为何选择香港拍卖？ -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>为何选择香港拍卖？</h2>\n    <ul class=\"list\">\n      <li>五大部门专家团队致力提供全面而专业的服务</li>\n      <li>紧贴市场趋势，彰显您藏品的非凡价值</li>\n      <li>卓越的全球网络，与海内外藏家保持紧密联系</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第一步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第一步：拍品估值</h2>\n    <p>香港拍卖提供在线估值与到访办公室估值两种方式，以便利广大藏家的需求。请注意，您需要先提供藏品的基本资料，我们才能为阁下安排与专家面谈的预约。</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">在线估值</span>\n        <p>您可以通过在线估值服务，在网上表格提供藏品资料及照片，以获取免费的在线估值。我们的专家将进一步与您联络，提供免费而专业的初步估值、销售策略与市场分析。您亦可在账户界面的委托记录功能中，实时查阅拍品的估值进度及状态。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">线下估值</span>\n        <p>您亦可以通过电话或电邮预约，莅临香港拍卖的本地或海外办事处，亲自携同藏品与我们的专家团队面谈接洽。我们的专家团队亦会在公开征集期间到访各大城市，与海内外藏家接洽。欢迎订阅电子报、关注香港拍卖的社交平台或查看即将举办的活动，以获取征集活动的最新消息。</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <p class=\"note\">所有由香港拍卖提供的估值均为临时估值，经正式鉴定后或会有所调整。若藏品类型或价值未能符合拍卖要求，我们恕未能提供估值。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第二步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第二步：拍卖及委托安排</h2>\n    <p>取得藏品的初步估值后，我们的专家团队将进一步与您商讨最合适的拍卖安排，务求让藏品彰显其非凡价值。您亦可选择通过私人洽购服务出售藏品，不受拍卖日程限制，同时提升私密性。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第三步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第三步：签订委托协议及运输</h2>\n    <p>在藏品正式上拍及刊登于拍卖图录前，您必须与我们签订委托协议。协议内容包括服务内容、估值范围及底价、收费详情以及拍卖条款与细则，并由卖方与香港拍卖共同确认。签订委托协议后，我们可为您安排装运服务，将拍品安全送抵香港拍卖办公室或艺术品仓库；若您选择自行安排运送，我们亦乐意提供运送方面的建议。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第四步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第四步：收费及付款</h2>\n    <p>我们会依据委托协议所订立的收费详情收取相关服务费用，一般包括卖家佣金和保险费。您亦可能需要缴付运输费、关税、香港寄售税、装裱或维护等服务费用。在正式收取任何额外费用前，我们会先与阁下商讨并达成一致。</p>\n    <p>拍卖会正式结束后，香港拍卖将通知您托售物品的情况及成交价。在买家已完成付款的前提下，款项将扣除所有开支费用后，于大约 35 天内存入您指定的银行账户。我们亦会发出一份拍品交易结算单，列明所有细项。如托售物品未能在拍卖会上售出，我们将与您联系，商讨下一步安排。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 页尾区块 -->\n  <section class=\"closing\">\n    <h2>在线估值服务</h2>\n    <p>通过简单步骤在线提供藏品资讯与照片，以最直接的方式获得专家团队的估值服务。</p>\n  </section>\n\n</main>', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. Design tokens\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* brand gold */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* headings */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* body text */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* secondary text */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* rules */\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* soft sand */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* max content width */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. Base reset\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. Page skeleton\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* Page header */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* gold rule under the title */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. Sections\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  /* Note / disclaimer */\n  .note {\n    margin-top: 1.5em;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: .9375rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. Lists\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .list, .steps { margin: 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .list:last-child, .steps:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* Bulleted list */\n  .list { list-style: none; }\n  .list > li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: .6em; }\n  .list > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .list > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: .82em;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  /* Numbered steps */\n  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }\n  .steps > li {\n    counter-increment: step;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .steps > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .steps > li::before {\n    content: counter(step);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: .25em;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--brand);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--brand);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .steps > li > .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    margin-bottom: .35em;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. Closing block\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .closing {\n    margin-top: var(--gap);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .closing h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .closing p { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. Responsive\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .steps > li { padding-left: 36px; }\n    .steps > li::before { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header, .closing, .note { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>Consign to Auction</h1>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">Consigning a work to Hong Kong Auction takes only a few steps. Our specialists are glad to provide professional valuations and market advice, and to guide you through the process of bringing your property to sale.</p>\n\n  <!-- Why consign with us -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Why consign with us?</h2>\n    <ul class=\"list\">\n      <li>Specialists across five departments, offering thorough and professional service</li>\n      <li>Close attention to market trends, so your property realises its full value</li>\n      <li>An established global network, in close contact with collectors at home and abroad</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Step one -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Step one: valuation</h2>\n    <p>Hong Kong Auction offers valuations online and at our offices, whichever suits you better. Please note that we need some basic information about the work before we can arrange an appointment with a specialist.</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Online valuation</span>\n        <p>Submit details and photographs of your property through the online valuation form to receive a free valuation. A specialist will then be in touch with a complimentary preliminary estimate, a proposed selling strategy and market analysis. You can follow the progress and status of your valuation at any time under Consignment Records in your account.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">In-person valuation</span>\n        <p>You are also welcome to make an appointment by telephone or email and bring your property to one of our offices in Hong Kong or overseas to meet a specialist in person. Our specialists also travel to major cities during open consignment periods. Subscribe to our newsletter, follow Hong Kong Auction on social media or check our upcoming events for the latest news.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <p class=\"note\">All valuations provided by Hong Kong Auction are provisional and may be revised after formal examination. Where the category or value of a work does not meet our auction criteria, we are unable to provide a valuation.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Step two -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Step two: planning the sale</h2>\n    <p>Once you have a preliminary estimate, our specialists will discuss the most suitable sale arrangements with you, so that the work is presented to its best advantage. You may also choose to sell privately, which is not tied to the auction calendar and offers greater discretion.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Step three -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Step three: consignment agreement and shipping</h2>\n    <p>Before a work can be offered for sale and published in the catalogue, you and Hong Kong Auction must sign a consignment agreement. It sets out the services provided, the estimate range and reserve, the charges, and the terms and conditions of sale, and is confirmed by both parties. Once signed, we can arrange shipping to a Hong Kong Auction office or art storage facility. If you prefer to arrange transport yourself, we are glad to advise.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Step four -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Step four: charges and settlement</h2>\n    <p>Charges are applied as set out in the consignment agreement, typically the seller\'s commission and insurance. Other costs may also apply, such as shipping, duties, Hong Kong consignment tax, framing or conservation. We will always discuss and agree any additional charges with you before they are incurred.</p>\n    <p>After the sale closes, Hong Kong Auction will inform you how your property performed and the price achieved. Provided the buyer has paid, the proceeds, less all charges, are transferred to your nominated bank account in approximately 35 days. You will also receive a settlement statement itemising every charge. If a work does not sell, we will contact you to discuss the next steps.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Closing block -->\n  <section class=\"closing\">\n    <h2>Online Valuation Service</h2>\n    <p>Submit details and photographs of your property online — the most direct way to reach our specialists for a valuation.</p>\n  </section>\n\n</main>', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. 設計變數\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* 品牌金 */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* 標題深色 */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* 正文 */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* 次要文字 */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* 分隔線 */\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* 淺米底 */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* 內容最大寬度 */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. 基礎重置\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial,\n    \"PingFang TC\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Noto Sans TC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. 版面骨架\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* 頁首 */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* 標題下的金色短線 */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. 章節\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  /* 附註／免責說明 */\n  .note {\n    margin-top: 1.5em;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: .9375rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. 清單\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .list, .steps { margin: 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .list:last-child, .steps:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* 項目符號清單 */\n  .list { list-style: none; }\n  .list > li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: .6em; }\n  .list > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .list > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: .82em;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  /* 編號步驟清單 */\n  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }\n  .steps > li {\n    counter-increment: step;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .steps > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .steps > li::before {\n    content: counter(step);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: .25em;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--brand);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--brand);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .steps > li > .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    margin-bottom: .35em;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. 頁尾區塊\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .closing {\n    margin-top: var(--gap);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .closing h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .closing p { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. 響應式\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .steps > li { padding-left: 36px; }\n    .steps > li::before { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header, .closing, .note { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>委託拍賣</h1>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">透過簡單步驟將藏品委託香港拍賣，開展您的賣家體驗。我們的專家團隊樂意為您提供專業的藝術品估值與市場諮詢服務，並協助您完成上拍手續。</p>\n\n  <!-- 為何選擇香港拍賣？ -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>為何選擇香港拍賣？</h2>\n    <ul class=\"list\">\n      <li>五大部門專家團隊致力提供全面而專業的服務</li>\n      <li>緊貼市場趨勢，彰顯您藏品的非凡價值</li>\n      <li>卓越的環球網絡，與海內外藏家保持緊密聯繫</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第一步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第一步：拍品估值</h2>\n    <p>香港拍賣提供線上與來訪辦公室方式估值，以方便廣大藏家的需求。請注意，您需要先提供藏品的基本資料，我們才能為閣下安排預約專家面談。</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">線上估值</span>\n        <p>您可以透過線上估值服務，在網上表格提供藏品資料及照片以獲取免費線上估值。我們的專家將會進一步與您聯絡，提供免費而專業的初步估值、銷售策略與市場分析。您亦可以於帳戶界面中的委託紀錄功能，即時查閱拍品估值進度及狀態。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">線下估值</span>\n        <p>您亦可以透過電話或電郵預約，蒞臨香港拍賣的本地或海外辦事處，親自攜同藏品與我們的專家團隊面談接洽。我們的專家團隊亦會於公開徵集期間到訪各大城市，與海內外藏家接洽，歡迎訂閱電子報、關注香港拍賣的社交平台或查看即將舉辦的活動，以獲取徵集活動的最新消息。</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <p class=\"note\">所有由香港拍賣提供的估值均為臨時估值，經正式鑑定後或會有所調整。若藏品類型或價值未能符合拍賣要求，我們恕未能提供估值。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第二步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第二步：拍賣及委託安排</h2>\n    <p>取得藏品的初步估值後，我們的專家團隊將會進一步與您商討最合適的拍賣安排，務求藏品彰顯藝術品的非凡價值。您亦可選擇透過私人洽購服務，出售您的藏品，不受拍賣日程限制同時提升私隱度。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第三步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第三步：簽定委託協議及運輸</h2>\n    <p>在藏品正式上拍及刊登於拍賣圖錄前，您必須與我們簽定委託協議，協議內容包括服務內容、估值範圍及底價、收費詳情以及拍賣條款與細則，並由賣方與香港拍賣共同確認。簽定委託協議後，我們能為您安排裝運服務，將拍品安全送抵香港拍賣辦公室或藝術品倉庫，若您選擇自行安排運送，我們亦樂意提供運送藏品的建議。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 第四步 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>第四步：收費及付款</h2>\n    <p>我們會依據委託協議所定立的收費詳情收取相關服務費用，一般包括賣家酬金和保險費，您亦可能需要繳付諸如運輸費、關稅、香港寄售稅、裝裱或維護等服務費用。在正式收取任何額外收費前，我們會與閣下商討再作協定。</p>\n    <p>在拍賣會正式結束後，香港拍賣將會通知您託售物品的情況及成交價。在買家已完成付款的前提下，款項將扣除所有開支收費並於大約 35 天內存入您指定的銀行帳戶內。我們亦會發出一份拍品交易結單，並列明所有細項。如託售物品未能於拍賣會售出，我們將會與您聯繫再作下一步安排。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 頁尾區塊 -->\n  <section class=\"closing\">\n    <h2>線上估值服務</h2>\n    <p>透過簡單步驟，在線提供藏品資訊與照片，以最直接方式取得專家團隊的估值服務。</p>\n  </section>\n\n</main>', 1, 1787046966, 1787474969);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (3, '参与竞投｜竞投登记手续及须知', '參與競投｜競投登記手續及須知', 'How to Buy | Bidder Registration and Guidelines', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. 设计变量\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* 品牌金 */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* 标题深色 */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* 正文 */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* 次要文字 */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* 分隔线 */\n    --line-strong:  #c9cccf;\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* 浅米底 */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* 内容最大宽度 */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-h3:        1.05rem;\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. 基础重置\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial,\n    \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. 版面骨架\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* 页首 */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* 标题下的金色短线 */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n  .page-header .lede {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. 章节\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .subsection { margin-top: 34px; }\n  .subsection > h3 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h3);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. 清单\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .list, .steps { margin: 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .list:last-child, .steps:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* 项目符号清单 */\n  .list { list-style: none; }\n  .list > li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: .6em; }\n  .list > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .list > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: .82em;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  /* 编号步骤清单 */\n  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }\n  .steps > li {\n    counter-increment: step;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .steps > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .steps > li::before {\n    content: counter(step);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: .25em;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--brand);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--brand);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .steps > li > .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    margin-bottom: .35em;\n  }\n  .steps .list { margin-top: .7em; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. 表格（竞投名义）\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);\n  }\n  .table th, .table td {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .table th {\n    width: 26%;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. 选项格（付款方式 / 提货方式）\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .options {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0 0 1.15em;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 12px;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));\n  }\n  .options > li {\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 2px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     8. 响应式\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .table, .table tbody, .table tr, .table th, .table td { display: block; width: 100%; }\n    .table { border-top: 0; }\n    .table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); padding-bottom: 6px; }\n    .table tr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .table th { white-space: normal; border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 10px; }\n    .table td { border-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; }\n\n    .steps > li { padding-left: 36px; }\n    .steps > li::before { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>参与竞投</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">竞投登记手续及须知</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">香港拍卖提供不同拍卖竞投形式，让您随时随地拍得心头好。从发掘心仪的拍品、开设竞投账户、出价竞投到运送您拍得的拍品，流程简易便捷。过程当中，我们的专家团队乐意为您提供市场及艺术收藏等各方面的专业意见。</p>\n\n  <!-- 了解最新拍卖资讯 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>了解最新拍卖资讯</h2>\n    <p>您可以通过多种方式了解最新的拍卖会及详细拍品资讯，包括：</p>\n    <ul class=\"list\">\n      <li>莅临拍卖预展亲身了解拍品，由专家团队为您提供详尽的拍品资料与市场分析</li>\n      <li>关注香港拍卖的社交平台或订阅电子报</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 登记竞投 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>登记竞投</h2>\n    <p>香港拍卖提供多种登记竞投方式，无论身处何地，线上线下均可完成简易的登记程序。只需填妥登记表格、提供相关证明文件并缴付保证金，即可参与竞投。</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">通过网站或 App 登记</span>\n        <p>您可以通过本网站或香港拍卖 App 填妥所需资料，并提供相关证明文件及在线缴付保证金（接受银联及美国运通信用卡），即完成登记手续。账户身份通过审批后，您将会收到确认通知，即可参与拍卖竞投。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">亲身莅临登记</span>\n        <p>您可以在拍卖开始前，莅临香港拍卖办公室或拍卖会场填妥竞投登记表格并完成开户手续，同时提供相关证明文件及缴付保证金（接受现金、支票、银行转账及信用卡）。若您身处海外，请与我们团队咨询，以了解各地的保证金缴付方式。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">通过邮寄登记</span>\n        <p>请填妥现场竞投登记表格，连同所需证明文件副本及保证金划线支票，于拍卖日前至少 3 个工作日，以邮寄或传真方式递交至香港拍卖办公室。完成登记及审批手续后，您将会收到电邮或电话确认通知。您亦可同步提交委托竞投登记表格，在开设账户时一并登记出价。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">于拍卖现场登记</span>\n        <p>您亦可以莅临预展现场的竞投登记处，一次性完成登记、缴付保证金及办理竞投牌号手续。各专场的登记于该专场开始前截止。</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"subsection\">\n      <h3>竞投名义</h3>\n      <p>我们提供以下三种竞投名义选项，只需提供相应证明文件，便能办妥竞投登记手续。</p>\n      <table class=\"table\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">个人客户</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>政府签发的附有照片的身份证明文件（如居民身份证或护照）</li>\n                <li>现时居住地址证明（如公用事业账单或银行对账单）</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">代理人客户</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>代理人的身份证明文件</li>\n                <li>代理人所代表的竞投人士／单位之身份证明文件</li>\n                <li>竞投人士／单位签发的授权书正本</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">商业客户</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>公司注册证书</li>\n                <li>股东证明文件</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 缴纳保证金 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>缴纳保证金</h2>\n    <p>领取竞投号牌前，您需要缴付竞投保证金。金额可参考专场页面内的保证金计算器，或向我们的财务客户关系及竞投部查询。若您未能成功购得拍品且对香港拍卖并无任何欠款，我们将于该拍卖场次结束后十四个工作日内通知金融机构，向阁下退回已付保证金（不含利息）；若阁下成功竞得拍品，香港拍卖有权以该保证金支付拍卖品款项。</p>\n    <p>请注意，香港拍卖不接受以第三方身份支付保证金，此规定亦适用于代理人。若阁下代表他人参与竞投，香港拍卖仅接受委托人名下的款项。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 参与竞投及出价 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>参与竞投及出价</h2>\n    <p>您可以通过以下三种形式参与香港的拍卖：</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">莅临现场竞投</span>\n        <p>亲身莅临拍卖会现场参与竞投，同时感受现场的热烈气氛。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">在线竞投</span>\n        <p>通过本网站或香港拍卖 App 观看拍卖现场实时直播，您可以随时随地参与实时在线竞投，投入拍卖现场盛况。您亦可通过拍卖微信小程序进行实时在线竞投。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">委托竞投</span>\n        <p>若无法亲临现场，您亦可通过电话或书面竞投服务，以委托形式参与拍卖竞投。请填妥委托竞投表格，并于拍卖日前至少 3 个工作日以邮寄、传真或电邮方式，递交至客户关系及竞拍部。</p>\n        <ul class=\"list\">\n          <li>选择“电话竞投”，香港拍卖团队将于拍卖现场与您通话，并根据您的实时指示代为出价。敬请留意，为保障客户利益及确保服务质量，竞投当时的通话内容将会录音。</li>\n          <li>选择“书面竞投”，您可通过书面出价的形式参与拍卖，香港拍卖团队将按照您的指示代为竞投。只需在委托竞投表格内填写您的最高竞投价格，您的书面竞投价将会被调整至最接近拍卖官递增幅度的竞投金额。若我们就同一拍品收到两个或以上相同的最高竞投价，且该拍品最终以该价格落槌成交，则拍品将归于最先将书面竞投表格送抵香港拍卖的竞投人。</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 支付款项 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>支付款项</h2>\n    <p>得标买家需要于拍卖成交当日起计 7 天内付清款项，包括落槌价及买家佣金。香港拍卖的佣金为落槌价的 20%，您可以通过我们的佣金计算器，对出价所涉及的汇率及佣金作初步计算。付款方式包括：</p>\n    <ul class=\"options\">\n      <li>电汇</li>\n      <li>信用卡或借记卡</li>\n      <li>支票</li>\n      <li>现金或银行本票</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>我们仅接受以登记人名下的付款方式支付，恕不接受第三方付款。完整付款细则载于图录及本网站内的《财务付款须知》，请注意其中部分项目并未列明于本简介。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 提取拍品 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>提取拍品</h2>\n    <p>完成付款后，您即可安排提取或运送拍品。您可以亲身或委托他人，到拍卖会现场（只适用于部分拍卖品）或香港办公室提取拍品，也可由我们认可的运输服务商安排运送，费用由买方承担。</p>\n    <ul class=\"options\">\n      <li>于拍卖会现场提货</li>\n      <li>莅临办事处提货</li>\n      <li>由运输服务商安排运送</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>您需要于拍卖成交当日起计 30 天内完成提货手续，否则我们将收取存仓费用（每月港币 1,200 元）及相关行政费用。此外，如欲授权第三方在现场或香港办公室提货，您需要填妥授权提货委托书并提供相关证明文件。</p>\n    <p>您也可授权运输服务商从我们的办事处提取货物，并运送至阁下指定的收货地点。您需承担其中涉及的成本与风险，而部分拍卖品可能受进出口限制。我们乐意提供运输方面的建议，或协助您选择合适的运输服务商。</p>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n</main>', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. Design tokens\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* brand gold */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* headings */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* body text */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* secondary text */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* rules */\n    --line-strong:  #c9cccf;\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* soft sand */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* max content width */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-h3:        1.05rem;\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. Base reset\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. Page skeleton\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* Page header */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* gold rule under the title */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n  .page-header .lede {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. Sections\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .subsection { margin-top: 34px; }\n  .subsection > h3 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h3);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. Lists\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .list, .steps { margin: 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .list:last-child, .steps:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* Bulleted list */\n  .list { list-style: none; }\n  .list > li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: .6em; }\n  .list > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .list > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: .82em;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  /* Numbered steps */\n  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }\n  .steps > li {\n    counter-increment: step;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .steps > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .steps > li::before {\n    content: counter(step);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: .25em;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--brand);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--brand);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .steps > li > .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    margin-bottom: .35em;\n  }\n  .steps .list { margin-top: .7em; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. Table (bidding capacity)\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);\n  }\n  .table th, .table td {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .table th {\n    width: 26%;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. Option grid (payment / collection)\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .options {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0 0 1.15em;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 12px;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));\n  }\n  .options > li {\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 2px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     8. Responsive\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .table, .table tbody, .table tr, .table th, .table td { display: block; width: 100%; }\n    .table { border-top: 0; }\n    .table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); padding-bottom: 6px; }\n    .table tr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .table th { white-space: normal; border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 10px; }\n    .table td { border-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; }\n\n    .steps > li { padding-left: 36px; }\n    .steps > li::before { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>How to Buy</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Bidder registration and what you need to know</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">Hong Kong Auction offers a range of bidding formats so you can pursue the pieces you love, wherever you are. From discovering a lot and opening a bidding account to placing your bid and arranging shipment, the process is straightforward throughout. At every stage, our specialists are glad to advise you on the market and on building a collection.</p>\n\n  <!-- Keeping up with our auctions -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Keeping up with our auctions</h2>\n    <p>There are several ways to follow our upcoming sales and view full lot details:</p>\n    <ul class=\"list\">\n      <li>Visit a pre-sale exhibition to view the works in person, where our specialists can provide full lot information and market analysis</li>\n      <li>Follow Hong Kong Auction on social media, or subscribe to our newsletter</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Registering to bid -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Registering to bid</h2>\n    <p>Hong Kong Auction offers several ways to register, online or in person, wherever you are. Simply complete the registration form, provide the required documents and pay a deposit, and you are ready to bid.</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Register via the website or App</span>\n        <p>Complete the required details on this website or in the Hong Kong Auction App, supply the supporting documents and pay your deposit online (UnionPay and American Express accepted). Once your account has been approved, you will receive a confirmation and may take part in the sale.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Register in person</span>\n        <p>Before the sale begins, you may visit a Hong Kong Auction office or the saleroom to complete the bidder registration form and open an account, providing the supporting documents and paying your deposit (cash, cheque, bank transfer and credit card accepted). If you are overseas, please contact our team to discuss the deposit arrangements for your location.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Register by post</span>\n        <p>Complete the saleroom bidder registration form and send it, together with copies of the required documents and a crossed cheque for the deposit, to a Hong Kong Auction office by post or fax at least 3 business days before the sale. Once registration and approval are complete, you will receive confirmation by email or telephone. You may also submit an absentee bid form at the same time, registering your bids as you open the account.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Register at the saleroom</span>\n        <p>You may also come to the registration desk at the pre-sale exhibition and complete registration, pay your deposit and collect your paddle in one visit. Registration for each sale closes before that sale begins.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"subsection\">\n      <h3>Bidding capacity</h3>\n      <p>You may register in any of the three capacities below. Simply provide the corresponding documents to complete your registration.</p>\n      <table class=\"table\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Individual</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>Government-issued photo identification (such as an identity card or passport)</li>\n                <li>Proof of current residential address (such as a utility bill or bank statement)</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Agent</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>The agent\'s identification document</li>\n                <li>Identification for the bidder or entity the agent represents</li>\n                <li>The original letter of authority issued by that bidder or entity</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Corporate</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>Certificate of incorporation</li>\n                <li>Documentation of shareholders</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Paying a deposit -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Paying a deposit</h2>\n    <p>A deposit is required before your paddle is issued. You can find the amount using the deposit calculator on the sale page, or ask our Financial Client Relations and Bidding department. If you are unsuccessful and owe Hong Kong Auction nothing, we will instruct the financial institution to return your deposit, without interest, within fourteen business days of the close of the sale. If you are successful, Hong Kong Auction may apply the deposit towards the purchase price.</p>\n    <p>Please note that Hong Kong Auction does not accept deposits paid by a third party. This applies to agents as well: if you are bidding on behalf of someone else, we can only accept funds held in the principal\'s name.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Bidding and placing your bid -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Bidding and placing your bid</h2>\n    <p>You can take part in our sales in any of three ways:</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Bid in the room</span>\n        <p>Attend the sale in person and bid from the room, where you can feel the atmosphere first-hand.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Bid online</span>\n        <p>Watch the saleroom live on this website or in the Hong Kong Auction App and bid in real time from anywhere. Live online bidding is also available through our WeChat Mini Program.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">Bid by proxy</span>\n        <p>If you cannot attend, you may bid by proxy using our telephone or written bidding service. Complete the absentee bid form and send it to Client Relations and Bidding by post, fax or email at least 3 business days before the sale.</p>\n        <ul class=\"list\">\n          <li>With telephone bidding, a member of the Hong Kong Auction team calls you from the saleroom and bids on your live instructions. Please note that these calls are recorded, to protect our clients\' interests and maintain the quality of the service.</li>\n          <li>With written bidding, you bid in writing and the Hong Kong Auction team executes your instructions. Simply enter your maximum bid on the absentee bid form; it will be rounded to the nearest bidding increment used by the auctioneer. Where we receive two or more identical highest bids for the same lot and it sells at that price, the lot goes to the bidder whose form reached Hong Kong Auction first.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Payment -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Payment</h2>\n    <p>Successful buyers must pay in full within 7 days of the sale date, covering both the hammer price and the buyer\'s premium. Hong Kong Auction\'s premium is 20% of the hammer price; our premium calculator gives you an indicative figure including the exchange rate. We accept:</p>\n    <ul class=\"options\">\n      <li>Wire transfer</li>\n      <li>Credit or debit card</li>\n      <li>Cheque</li>\n      <li>Cash or cashier\'s order</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>We can only accept payment from an account in the registered buyer\'s name; third-party payments cannot be accepted. The full payment terms appear in the catalogue and in the Financial Payment Notice on this website, which covers points not set out in this summary.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Collecting your lot -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>Collecting your lot</h2>\n    <p>Once payment is complete you can arrange collection or shipping. You may collect in person, or send someone on your behalf, from the saleroom (available for certain lots only) or from our Hong Kong office. Alternatively, one of our approved shippers can deliver the work, at the buyer\'s expense.</p>\n    <ul class=\"options\">\n      <li>Collect at the saleroom</li>\n      <li>Collect from our office</li>\n      <li>Shipping by an approved carrier</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Collection must be completed within 30 days of the sale date; after that, storage charges of HK$1,200 per month plus related administrative fees will apply. If you wish to authorise a third party to collect on your behalf, at the saleroom or from our Hong Kong office, please complete a collection authorisation form and provide the supporting documents.</p>\n    <p>You may also authorise a shipper to collect from our office and deliver to an address of your choosing. The cost and risk are yours, and some lots may be subject to import or export restrictions. We are happy to advise on shipping or to help you select a suitable carrier.</p>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n</main>', '<style>\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     1. 設計變數\n     ========================================================================== */\n  :root {\n    --brand:        #bf9d5a;   /* 品牌金 */\n    --ink:          #1e2123;   /* 標題深色 */\n    --text:         #33383c;   /* 正文 */\n    --text-muted:   #6b7176;   /* 次要文字 */\n    --line:         #e3e5e7;   /* 分隔線 */\n    --line-strong:  #c9cccf;\n    --bg:           #ffffff;\n    --bg-soft:      #f7f6f3;   /* 淺米底 */\n\n    --wrap:         820px;     /* 內容最大寬度 */\n    --gap:          clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n\n    --fs-h1:        clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 2.75rem);\n    --fs-h2:        clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);\n    --fs-h3:        1.05rem;\n    --fs-body:      1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     2. 基礎重置\n     ========================================================================== */\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial,\n    \"PingFang TC\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Noto Sans TC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: var(--fs-body);\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     3. 版面骨架\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wrap);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);\n  }\n\n  /* 頁首 */\n  .page-header {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-header h1 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h1);\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .page-header h1::after {           /* 標題下的金色短線 */\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 2px;\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n  .page-header .lede {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  main { padding: var(--gap) 0 clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px); }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin-bottom: var(--gap);\n    padding-bottom: var(--gap);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     4. 章節\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .section + .section { margin-top: var(--gap); }\n\n  .section > h2 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h2);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .subsection { margin-top: 34px; }\n  .subsection > h3 {\n    font-size: var(--fs-h3);\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     5. 清單\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .list, .steps { margin: 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .list:last-child, .steps:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* 項目符號清單 */\n  .list { list-style: none; }\n  .list > li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: .6em; }\n  .list > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .list > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: .82em;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--brand);\n  }\n\n  /* 編號步驟清單 */\n  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }\n  .steps > li {\n    counter-increment: step;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .steps > li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .steps > li::before {\n    content: counter(step);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: .25em;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--brand);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--brand);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .steps > li > .step-title {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    margin-bottom: .35em;\n  }\n  .steps .list { margin-top: .7em; }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     6. 表格（競投名義）\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);\n  }\n  .table th, .table td {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .table th {\n    width: 26%;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     7. 選項格（付款方式 / 提貨方式）\n     ========================================================================== */\n  .options {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0 0 1.15em;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 12px;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));\n  }\n  .options > li {\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-top: 2px solid var(--brand);\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    letter-spacing: .04em;\n  }\n\n  /* ==========================================================================\n     8. 響應式\n     ========================================================================== */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { line-height: 1.85; }\n\n    .table, .table tbody, .table tr, .table th, .table td { display: block; width: 100%; }\n    .table { border-top: 0; }\n    .table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); padding-bottom: 6px; }\n    .table tr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .table th { white-space: normal; border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 10px; }\n    .table td { border-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; }\n\n    .steps > li { padding-left: 36px; }\n    .steps > li::before { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page-header { background: #fff; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>參與競投</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">競投登記手續及須知</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">香港拍賣提供不同拍賣競投形式，讓您隨時隨地投得心頭好。由發掘心儀的拍品、開設競投帳戶、出價競投到運送您投得的拍品，流程簡易便捷。過程當中，我們的專家團隊樂意為您提供市場及藝術收藏等各方面專業意見。</p>\n\n  <!-- 瞭解最新拍賣資訊 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>瞭解最新拍賣資訊</h2>\n    <p>您可以透過多種方法瞭解最新的拍賣會及詳細拍品資訊，包括：</p>\n    <ul class=\"list\">\n      <li>蒞臨拍賣預展親身瞭解拍品，由專家團隊為您提供詳盡拍品資料與市場分析</li>\n      <li>關注香港拍賣的社交平台或訂閱電子報</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 登記競投 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>登記競投</h2>\n    <p>香港拍賣提供多種登記競投方式，不論身處何地、線上線下亦可完成簡易的登記程序，只需填妥登記表格、提供相關證明文件、繳付保證金即可參與競投。</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">透過網站或 App 登記</span>\n        <p>您可以透過本網站或香港拍賣 App 填妥所需資料，並提供相關證明文件及線上繳付保證金（接受銀聯及美國運通信用卡）即完成登記手續。帳戶身份通過審批後，您將會收到確認通知，即可參與拍賣競投。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">親身蒞臨登記</span>\n        <p>您可以在拍賣開始前，蒞臨香港拍賣辦公室或拍賣會場所填妥競投登記表格及完成開戶手續，並提供相關證明文件及繳付保證金（接受現金、支票、銀行轉帳及信用卡）。若您身處海外，請與我們團隊洽詢以瞭解各地保證金繳付方式。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">透過郵寄登記</span>\n        <p>請填妥現場競投登記表格，連同所需證明文件副本及保證金劃線支票，於拍賣日前至少 3 個工作天，以郵寄或傳真方式遞交至香港拍賣辦公室，完成登記及審批手續後，您將會收到電郵或電話確認通知。您亦可以同步提交委託競投登記表格，於開設帳戶時同時登記出價。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">於拍賣現場登記</span>\n        <p>您亦可以蒞臨預展現場的競投登記處，一次過完成登記、繳付保證金及辦理拍賣牌號手續。各專場的登記會於專場開始前結束。</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"subsection\">\n      <h3>競投名義</h3>\n      <p>我們提供以下三種競投名義選項，只需提供相應證明文件，便能辦妥競投登記手續。</p>\n      <table class=\"table\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">個人客戶</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>政府發出附有照片的身份證明文件（如居民身份證或護照）</li>\n                <li>現時居住地址證明（如公用事業賬單或銀行月結單）</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">代理人客戶</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>代理人的身份證明文件</li>\n                <li>代理人代表的競投人士／單位之身份證明文件</li>\n                <li>競投人士／單位簽發的授權書正本</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">商業客戶</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul class=\"list\">\n                <li>公司註冊證書</li>\n                <li>股東證明文件</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 繳納保證金 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>繳納保證金</h2>\n    <p>領取競投號牌前，您需要繳付競投保證金，金額可參考專場頁面內的保證金計算器，或向我們的財務客戶關係及競投部查詢。若您未能成功購得拍品且對香港拍賣無任何欠款，該保證金將在拍賣場次結束後十四個工作日內通知金融機構向閣下退回已付保證金（不包含利息）；若閣下成功競得拍品，香港拍賣有權使用該保證金支付拍賣品款項。</p>\n    <p>請注意，香港拍賣不接受第三方身份支付保證金。此規定亦適用於代理人。若閣下代表他人參與競投，香港拍賣僅接受委託人名下的款項。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 參與競投及出價 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>參與競投及出價</h2>\n    <p>您可以透過以下三種形式參與香港的拍賣：</p>\n\n    <ol class=\"steps\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">蒞臨現場競投</span>\n        <p>親身蒞臨拍賣會現場參與競投，亦能感受現場熱烈氣氛。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">線上競投</span>\n        <p>透過本網站或香港拍賣 App 觀看拍賣現場即時直播，您可以隨時隨地參與實時線上競投，投入拍賣現場盛況。您亦可透過拍賣微信小程序進行實時線上競投。</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"step-title\">委託競投</span>\n        <p>若無法親臨現場，您亦可透過電話或書面競投服務，以委託形式參與拍賣競投。請填妥委託競投表格，並於拍賣日前至少 3 個工作天以郵寄、傳真或電郵方式，遞交至客戶關係及競拍部。</p>\n        <ul class=\"list\">\n          <li>選擇「電話競投」，香港拍賣團隊將於拍賣現場與您電話通話，並根據您的實時指示參與出價。敬請留意，為保障客戶利益及確保服務質素，競投當時之通話內容將被錄音。</li>\n          <li>選擇「書面競投」，您可通過書面出價的形式參與拍賣，香港拍賣團隊將按照您的指示代為競投。只需在委託競投表格內填寫您的最高競投價格，您的書面競投價將會被調整至最接近拍賣官遞增的競投金額。若我們就同一拍品收到兩個或以上相同的最高競投價，且最終拍品以該價格落槌成交，則該拍賣品將歸於最先將其書面競投表格送抵香港拍賣的競投人。</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 支付款項 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>支付款項</h2>\n    <p>得標買家需要於拍賣成交當日起計 7 天內清付款項，包括落槌價及買家佣金。香港拍賣的佣金為落槌價之 20%，您可以透過我們的佣金計算器為閣下出價提供匯率及佣金初步計算。付款方式包括：</p>\n    <ul class=\"options\">\n      <li>電匯</li>\n      <li>信用卡或扣帳卡</li>\n      <li>支票</li>\n      <li>現金或銀行本票</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>我們僅接受以登記人名下之付款方式支付，恕不接受以第三方身分付款。完整付款細則載於圖錄及本網站內之《財務付款須知》，請注意部分並未列明在本簡介內之項目。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 提取拍品 -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <h2>提取拍品</h2>\n    <p>當您完成付款後，即可以安排提取或運送拍品。您可以親身或委託他人，到拍賣會現場（只適用於部份拍賣品）或香港辦公室提取拍品，或由我們認可的運輸服務商安排運送，費用由買方承擔。</p>\n    <ul class=\"options\">\n      <li>於拍賣會現場提貨</li>\n      <li>蒞臨辦事處提貨</li>\n      <li>由運輸服務商安排運送</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>您需要於拍賣成交當日起計 30 天內完成提貨手續，否則我們將同時收取存倉費用（每月港幣 1,200 元）及相關行政費用。此外，如欲授權第三方在現場或香港辦公室提貨，您需要填妥授權提貨委託書及相關證明文件。</p>\n    <p>您也可授權運輸服務商由我們的辦事處提取貨物，並運送至閣下指定的收貨地點。您需要承擔所涉及的成本與風險，而部份拍賣品可能受出入口限制。我們樂意提供運輸相關的建議或協助您選擇合適的運輸服務商。</p>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n</main>', 1, 1787048766, 1787474838);
INSERT INTO `setting` VALUES (1, 'site_name', '东方国际拍卖', 1786973051, 1788940917);
